  "cues": [
   [
    0.117,
    "Start with the overall equation."
   ],
   [
    2.135,
    "One glucose and six oxygens make six carbon dioxides and six waters, and energy is released."
   ],
   [
    9.219,
    "Glucose loses electrons, and loses hydrogen with them."
   ],
   [
    12.982,
    "It is oxidized."
   ],
   [
    14.271,
    "Oxygen gains electrons, and gains hydrogen, and becomes water."
   ],
   [
    18.854,
    "It is reduced."
   ],
   [
    20.143,
    "So respiration is a long move of electrons, travelling with hydrogen atoms, from the fuel all the way to oxygen."
   ],
   [
    28.138,
    "And on the way, they fall in energy."
   ],
   [
    30.69,
    "That fall is what the cell harvests."
   ]
  ]
