  "cues": [
   [
    0.156,
    "Think of NAD\u207a as an empty shuttle bus."
   ],
   [
    3.672,
    "At the fuel, it picks up two electrons, and it is now NADH."
   ],
   [
    8.828,
    "The full bus is stored energy."
   ],
   [
    10.938,
    "Those electrons are still high in energy, and the cell can tap that energy to make A T P."
   ],
   [
    17.005,
    "So the bus rides to the electron transport chain, and unloads its electrons there."
   ],
   [
    22.266,
    "Then it is NAD\u207a again, and goes back for more."
   ],
   [
    25.924,
    "The cell holds only a small supply of these molecules, so they must be reused over and over."
   ],
   [
    32.148,
    "If the buses stopped coming back, the fuel could not be oxidized at all."
   ]
  ]
