    42.318,
    "Oxygen is the final acceptor, and its pull is what keeps electrons coming down."
   ],
   [
    47.552,
    "The picture draws three A T P bursts and four complexes, but those are only drawings."
   ],
   [
    53.49,
    "We count the A T P properly in lesson seven."
